        "id": "draft-prompt",
        "kind": "prompt",
        "text": "At the desk, write the opening of a different story. Help your reader understand the situation, the narrator, and the characters. Use the clue as an example, not as words to copy. Compare your opening with the clue, revise it, then take it to the archive.",
